params.description:
`playcounts`: `playcount` (lifetime plays) on every `tracks.items[]` entry, one call per
album (about +0.3 s, cached 1 h). `include_status` reports `{requested, resolved}`;
a track whose count could not be fetched has `playcount: null`.

Result type. `multi` returns every bucket plus top results. A single type is answered
from Spotify's own search for that type (the web player's Songs / Artists / Albums… tabs):
about twice as fast as `multi`, and object buckets carry `pagingInfo` (`limit`, `nextOffset`).
